"entity": {
"name": "Quaker Houghton",
"description": "Quaker Houghton engages in the development and production of formulated specialty chemical products and offers chemical management services for various heavy industrial and manufacturing applications. The firm operates through the following geographical segments: Americas, Europe, Middle East and Africa, and Asia Pacific. Its products include can making lubricants, cleaners, coatings, cold rolling oils, corrosion preventives, die casting lubricants, dust suppressants, greases, ground control agents, hot rolling oils, hydraulic fluids, industrial lubricants, longwall fluids, metal forming fluids, metal removal fluids, pickle oils, surface treatments, temper fluids, and tin plating. The company was founded in 1918 and is headquartered in Conshohocken, PA.",
